          {
            "text": "Registrar Nara Quill - Nara Quill is Crownwake’s senior public registrar for vessel title and civil identity disputes. She is famous mainly among lawyers, owners, and hackers, where her refusal to treat old records as automatically correct has earned both trust and enemies.",
            "type": "npc",
            "gameTick": -1,
