            "text": "Ghost discovered a self-powered, refrigerated cargo seal node cycling behind bay three's bulkhead that resists remote queries. Ghost confirmed Vesper Nine's systems are nominal, fuel is under two-thirds, and successfully queued a preliminary Guild claim for the 800 tonnes of cargo after correcting a timestamp discrepancy. Pike exited the airlock and began cutting the starboard cargo door's hinge side with his torch.\n\nVessel Ledger: Vesper Nine, [Hull Class: Not Specified], Condition: [Not Specified], Route: Ninefold side, Owner/Public Identity: Ghost, Command Access: Ghost, Liens: [Not Specified], Crew: Ghost, Pike, Cargo: None, Fuel/Ammo: Just under two-thirds fuel, Installed Systems: Courier-class shield generator.",
