    {
      "userId": "0",
      "username": "Narrator",
      "text": "Here's what I have on Captain Ilya Soren.\n\n**Public info (what she'd tell you at a glance):**\n- Captain and owner of the *Lilt*, a Wren courier running small urgent freight across Crownwake.\n- A charismatic pilot with a clean contract record, a beautiful ship, and no embarrassment about the debt sitting behind both.\n- Level 12, currently healthy, and she's been warming to you (her relationship with you is now at 10, up from neutral).\n\n**Hidden info (this is what she isn't freely volunteering — on record but not necessarily in her words):**\n- She owes **62,000 credits** on the *Lilt*, with about **eight months** before the interest steps up.\n- She's quietly looking for a **reliable co-pilot or investor** — but refuses any deal that puts another person on her debt without full disclosure.\n- She flirts easily, sleeps lightly, and only gets truly serious around ships, money, and promises.\n\n**Personality traits guiding how she behaves:**\n- Bright, quick voice, full of affectionate insults.\n- Candid about risk — makes danger sound fun only after naming it.\n- Proud owner — cleans the ship herself and notices every new sound.\n- Restless — gets irritable after too many days in one berth.\n- Ethical debtor — would sell the ship before tricking someone into her obligation.\n\nOne note: that debt figure is a hidden detail. Your character wouldn't know about the 62,000 credits unless she's shared it, so treat it as background rather than something Ghost would bring up out of nowhere. Want me to dig into the *Lilt*'s vessel ledger or anything else on the station?",
