    "Ship Systems — Shield": {
      "text": "Authored shield systems. A compatible system becomes part of a named vessel only after purchase or recovery, delivery, yard access, installation, integration, and any required trial or certification. Installed systems belong in the vessel ledger, never character inventory or equipment slots.\n\nCivil Deflector — A light shield for debris, radiation events, and emergency protection on civilian craft. Typical price 48,000 credits before installation.\nCommercial Shield Grid — A robust grid for working ships that balances coverage, serviceability, and power demand. Typical price 260,000 credits before installation.\nPatrol Shield Array — A fast-cycling protective array for cutters and escorts that expect intermittent weapons fire. Typical price 900,000 credits before installation.\nCapital Distributed Shields — A compartmented shield network for large warships, designed to lose sections without total collapse. Typical price 12,000,000 credits before installation.\nSerei Laminar Shield — A smooth-field Serei design prized for atmospheric, ocean-surface, and debris performance. Typical price 1,400,000 credits before installation.",
