      "text": "Authored sensors systems. A compatible system becomes part of a named vessel only after purchase or recovery, delivery, yard access, installation, integration, and any required trial or certification. Installed systems belong in the vessel ledger, never character inventory or equipment slots.\n\nCivil Navigation Sensors — A certified suite for traffic, terrain, weather, docking, and ordinary collision avoidance. Typical price 32,000 credits before installation.\nSurvey Sensor Suite — A broad scientific package with deployable probes, spectral analysis, and calibrated mapping. Typical price 380,000 credits before installation.\nPassive Recon Array — Long-baseline passive receivers and thermal discipline for finding contacts without broadcasting. Typical price 820,000 credits before installation.\nFleet Fire-Control Array — A hardened sensor and computation suite for shared targeting, threat tracks, and defensive fire. Typical price 3,600,000 credits before installation.\nForensic Sensor Lab — A calibrated lab for reconstructing emissions, impacts, drives, residue, and recent physical events. Typical price 1,100,000 credits before installation.",
