t, a cached portrait, or a proposed voice conflicts with the stored record, the stored record wins and the conflicting output must be regenerated or corrected. Never silently flip an established NPC. Only an explicit, resolved in-world identity or body change can update the record, and then all dependent fields must be updated together.",
