        "Narrator: <focus:Ghost> Ghost recalls both drones with a single command; drone 1 and drone 2 break off the wrecked skiff and slide into escort positions flanking the Vesper Nine, railgun and pulse lasers powered down, oculars holding steady green.",
        "Pike: [gravelly, low whistle] Two combat drones on your channel, a loaded courier, and a full cradle. That chrome yacht's just sitting there — nobody's flying it home on its own.",
