        "Narrator: The courier answers with an automated registry burst — a luxury yacht-class hull, owner registry flagged delinquent, no life signs aboard, and a single line of automated text scrolling across Ghost's board: AUTOMATED STEWARD ACTIVE — AWAITING RECOVERY INSTRUCTIONS.",
        "Pike: [gravelly] No crew, no owner answering. Automated steward's waiting on instructions, and those skiff rats will be limping back to Brasse with nothing. Talk to it or crack it — either way, decide before somebody else shows up."
